{"product_id":"remote-assist-kit-lx1","title":"Remote Assist Kit - LX1","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eEmpower frontline and field workers with hands-free remote assistance using the Vuzix Remote Assist Kit. Designed for real-world environments, this turnkey solution enables workers to securely share their point of view with remote experts—improving speed, accuracy, and first-time fix rates. \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eWith a connection to your favorite collaboration platform, and a rugged, field-ready kit, teams can deploy quickly and start collaborating immediately. Each kit includes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e LX1 Smart Glasses\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e7000 mAh Battery Pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeadband Mount\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBump Cap Mounts\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB-A to USB-C Charging Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCustom Hard Case\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVuzix Bump Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003ePre-loaded software to connect with Microsoft Teams and Zoom\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vuzix Corporation","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":56158888853670,"sku":"516T00003","price":2099.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/LX1Isometric2_47e5a8e1-449b-44d2-a192-1821a7c74b1b.jpg?v=1770666954","url":"https:\/\/www.vuzix.com\/products\/remote-assist-kit-lx1","provider":"Vuzix Corporation","version":"1.0","type":"link"}